### Simple api
GET http://localhost:3000/hello

### Create new user
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "khang",
    "email": "khang17@gmail.com",
    "gender": "male",
    "age": 22,
    "address": "Nghe An"
}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/users/1

### Update user by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "khang",
    "email": "khanghoangvan29042003@gmail.com",
    "gender": "male",
    "age": 18,
    "address": "Nghe An"
}

### Delete user by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/1